{"symbol":"GALACTICO","yahoo":"GALACTICO.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Galactico Corporate Services Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Beverages - Non-Alcoholic","website":"https://galacticocorp.com","about":"Galactico Corporate Services Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells packaged drinking water in India. It operates in four segments: Investment Banking; Financial Services & Investment; Packaged Drinking Water Bottles Manufacturing; and Pest Control Services. The company also provides investment banking and issue management services for the mid-cap, SME, and startup sectors; and financial and investment services. In addition, it renders pest control services to corporates, societies, and households. Further, the company offers IPO/rights issue/FPO; corporate valuations/fairness opinions; mergers; corporate restructuring; main board and SME listings on stock exchanges; corporate advisory for corporate actions, such as open offer, buyback, delisting, amalgamation, and demergers; QIB placement; capital market; ESOP activity and management; debt syndication; private equity advisory; structured solutions; and secretarial compliance services. Galactico Corporate Services Limited was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Nashik, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:23:15+00:00","quote":{"price":1.92,"prevClose":1.97,"marketCap":35.19,"high52":2.69,"low52":1.45,"pe":64.0,"bookValue":2.88,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":18.3284,"insiders":48.38,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2019-10-09","2019-10-10","2019-10-11","2019-10-14","2019-10-15","2019-10-16","2019-10-17","2019-10-18","2019-10-22","2019-10-23","2019-10-24","2019-10-25","2019-10-29","2019-10-30","2019-10-31","2019-11-01","2019-11-04","2019-11-05","2019-11-06","2019-11-07","2019-11-08","2019-11-11","2019-11-13","2019-11-14","2019-11-15","2019-11-18","2019-11-19","2019-11-20","2019-11-21","2019-11-22","2019-11-25","2019-11-26","2019-11-27","2019-11-28","2019-1